        156.63470458984375,
        414.0581359863281,
        175.43360900878906
      ],
      "text": "Not sure I say the selection of those would be quite limited.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        188.43470764160156,
        498.3727111816406,
        226.5137481689453
      ],
      "text": "Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at\nquestions five to ten. Now listen and answer questions 5 to 10.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        239.97206115722656,
        105.86299896240234,
        259.47344970703125
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        260.0746765136719,
        436.7023010253906,
        278.87359619140625
      ],
      "text": "I’ve just thought of another idea. Have you been to the Audley?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        291.6920471191406,
        128.062255859375,
        311.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        311.793701171875,
        336.6231994628906,
        330.5926208496094
      ],
      "text": "No, don’t think I’ve heard of it. How’s it spelt?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        343.4110412597656,
        105.86299896240234,
        362.9124450683594
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        363.5146789550781,
        524.09716796875,
        382.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "A-U-D-L-E-Y. You must have heard of it. There’s been a lot about it in the press.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        395.2520446777344,
        128.062255859375,
        414.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        415.23468017578125,
        520.4622192382812,
        434.0335998535156
      ],
      "text": "I don’t tend to pay much attention to that kind of thing. So where is it exactly?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        446.85205078125,
        105.86299896240234,
        466.35345458984375
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        466.95367431640625,
        374.45892333984375,
        485.7525939941406
      ],
      "text": "It’s in that hotel near Baxter Bridge, on the top floor.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        498.6920166015625,
        128.062255859375,
        518.1934204101562
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        518.6747436523438,
        354.418212890625,
        537.4736328125
      ],
      "text": "Oh, the views would be incredible from up there.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        550.4110107421875,
        105.86299896240234,
        569.9124145507812
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        570.3937377929688,
        506.21881103515625,
        609.1135864257812
      ],
      "text": "Yeah, I’d love to go. I can’t think of the chef’s name, but she was a judge on\nthat TV cookery show recently. And she’s written a couple of cookery books.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        622.0520629882812,
        128.062255859375,
        641.553466796875
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
